[11:12:25] HARNESS: try 1: 11.4 s, exit 0, answer '{"proposal": {}, "why": "I would hold every number this cycle. The only restock change is breadth_lines 6 and sku_cap 8 from 10:08, and it has one reading since (88 deals/h, 3.86M revenue/h, rank still 15) against 136 deals/h before it, which is too little to judge. Stock is 14.0M at cost under the 18M cap with 44M cash, so capital is not what limits sales, and breadth and talks are.", "ideas": ["No number can choose which categories restock fills. breadth_lines only sets how many lines go to empty categories, so the 8-of-140 gap needs a category-level demand list from the harness, since demand_top_skus is all bedding and furniture.", "No merchandising number can raise the close rate on dear buyer orders, which is 61% against 51% for mid-priced orders and worth about 260k per miss. That needs per-order effort and the 20-second wait changed in the buyer code."]}'
