[11/11 04:46:17] HARNESS: try 1: 22.8 s, exit 0, answer '{"lessons":[{"rule":"Look for more changes like the heat-scaled depth for a 150-300k goods SKU at DEAR_HOT or more (dear_depth times a heat capped at 2x; the 5x cap stays for 300k+). Put capital and depth behind the market\'s hot sellers, since that is how the shop gets faster turns. Judge each such change on board_pts_h on a closed window.","evidence":["F90","F88","F84"],"status":"verified","trap":"It measured shop_revenue_h +398% and shop points/h +613% net of the market, against +8% expected, so do not forecast anything near that size. The supervisor restored the 5x cap (F88) at 11:18, 15 minutes before F90 at 11:33. The window may therefore hold both changes, so do not credit all of the gain to the 2x cap."},{"rule":"Change one shop number at a time and judge it alone on board_pts_h on a closed window. A raw margin move is no evidence when another change fell in the same hours.","evidence":["F104","F92","F94","F95","F97","F101","F102","F103"],"status":"verified","trap":"max_list 1200000 -> 900000 is the only number judged alone and VERIFIED (F104): points/h net of the market +50%, 356/5987 sales against 243/6015. Earlier max_list moves, and the stock_value, reserve_cash, warranty_hours and final_frac moves bunched on 11/09 13:17-15:11 and 11/10 12:31-16:21, were MIXED, with raw margin swings like +578%, +717% and +991%. These give no verdict, so do not cite them as support for a value."},{"rule":"Be wary of code that makes restock buy less (reserves, extra skips, surge cut-offs, drop rules). Each one reverted: GOODS_RESERVE, HOT_RESERVE, the stale-stock stock_value exclusion, surge_margin, dear_surge_max, and the drop above 2x max_list. The aim is more paid sales from the same capital, so prefer changes that release capital for sellers.","evidence":["F28","F42","F50","F53","F64","F80"],"status":"unverified","trap":"All these verdicts are raw before/after reads of the hour of day, so they are weak. They are not proof that every gate harms. Two changes that only freed stock_value for slow 300k+ units were kept (F57, F66). F84 shows the raw read can be wrong: it reverted a 5x heat cap at raw -20%, and the restored cap then scored +613% points/h in F90. Re-judge any such gate on board_pts_h."},{"rule":"Do not size a stock cap from our own recent sales rate when a restock bug may have depressed it. First check that the shop was buying the market\'s best sellers.","evidence":["F26"],"status":"unverified","trap":"A cap of 4 h of our own 300k+ sales (2.2 an hour) was reverted. Those sales were low because restock had not bought the market\'s best sellers until 12:46 (a ranking and room bug, fixed 12:46-13:48). The cap would have locked in the bug. The verdict was a weak raw before/after."},{"rule":"Judge the food shelf-life change (selling food categories need min(min_shelf_hours, 48)) on board_pts_h on a closed window. Do not judge it on shelf_refused_h, which is only a part.","evidence":["F77"],"status":"unverified","trap":"It was kept although shelf_refused_h was expected -30% and measured +21%, the wrong way. The read was raw before/after (weak), so it is neither proof of harm nor of benefit."}]}'
