[11/12 12:08:23] HARNESS: try 1: 20.3 s, exit 0, answer '{"lessons": [\n{"rule": "Judge a change on board_pts_h net of the market, and only a change made alone earns that verdict. In play mode several numbers may move in one cycle, and code changes may ship alongside them, but a bundle gets no credit and must not be cited as a finding. Rows marked MIXED, and raw-margin rows from before 11/9 11:13, are no evidence for or against any number.", "evidence": ["F104", "F107"], "status": "verified", "trap": "Reading a MIXED row, such as a raw margin of +222% or -70% with several other changes in the same hours, as proof that a number works or fails. Only the single-change reads (F104, F107) carry a verdict. Also, never step a number again in the same direction before its last change has a closed 2 h verdict (standing order 9)."},\n{"rule": "Raising stock_value is not a proven lever for points. The one single-change verified read (140000000 -> 150000000) made no difference beyond noise. Look first for changes that speed up turns, and judge any capital change alone.", "evidence": ["F107"], "status": "verified", "trap": "Raising stock_value again and again to buy more paid sales. 11/11 09:39 showed value share +16% and raw margin +16% (278/5468 -> 245/5760 sales), which is noise."},\n{"rule": "max_list has one verified read: 1200000 -> 900000 raised points/h net of the market by 50% (value share +32%, 243/6015 -> 356/5987 sales). Treat every other value or later move as untested, and judge any further move of max_list alone.", "evidence": ["F104"], "status": "verified", "trap": "Treating the many later max_list moves, which all sat inside bundles of other changes and are MIXED, as findings."},\n{"rule": "Do not revert a code change, or build on one, from a raw before/after read, because it reads the hour of day. Wait for a board_pts_h verdict net of the market. A reverted idea may be restored and judged again. Hot-line depth was the one code lever that paid on the board\'s terms: letting a 150-300k goods SKU at DEAR_HOT or more take dear_depth times a heat capped at 2x (5x stays for 300k+) was kept, with shop points/h +613% net of the market (revenue +398%).", "evidence": ["F80", "F84", "F88", "F90"], "status": "verified", "trap": "The heat cap 3.0x -> 5.0x (11/09 08:06) was reverted on a raw shop_margin_h of -20%, and the 11/09 04:44 change on -36%. Both were weak raw reads. After the restore of 4d10151 (11/09 11:18), the follow-up with the 2x heat cap won on the net-of-market read."}\n]}'
