00k+, was kept with shop_revenue_h +398% and points/h +613% net of the market. Do not revert a code change from a raw before/after read, because it reads the hour of day. Wait for a board_pts_h verdict net of the market, and restore a reverted idea if the evidence supports it.", "evidence": ["F84", "F88", "F90"], "status": "verified", "trap": "The heat cap 3.0x -> 5.0x (F84) was reverted on a raw shop_margin_h of -20% over 3 h, which is a weak read. The supervisor restored it (F88), and the refined version then won (F90). Later heat and surge edits (F132, F143, F163) were MIXED or had no verdict, so they do not show that the depth rules work."}, {"rule": "Ship a code change in a cycle with no number moves, so that it can earn a clean verdict. Code changes that landed beside number changes (F123, F132, F135, F143, F158) were all MIXED, and their kept or reverted outcomes, such as the guard revert in F143, are not evidence about the idea.", "evidence": ["F90", "F123", "F132", "F135", "F143", "F158"], "status": "verified", "trap": "Citing F132 (points/h +810%) or F143 (revenue -63%, reverted) as proof for or against a code idea. Both were judged while market_ask, floor_frac_food and other numbers moved in the same hours."}]}'
