ected -5%, measured +13%) were marked kept although they missed. 11/12 21:47 was judged on seconds per order, not points/h."},\n{"rule": "MAX_TRIES 6 -> 5 has one points/h read: +14% at +0.5 sd (11/12 19:00), with close rate 0.866 -> 0.8 and both arms negative. It is a single weak result, so confirm it before relying on it. Read the value now first and judge on points/h.", "evidence": ["F71"], "status": "verified", "trap": "The row says \'not taken\' and close rate fell, so it is easy to dismiss. The 11/05 16:16 row was judged on surplus and close rate, so it does not count against it."}\n]}'
