driven. Both changes (11/03 21:10 and 11/03 21:24) have no verdict, so nothing shows the mix avoids dislike stances."},\n{"rule": "Posting cadence is fixed at 310 s by code and is not a lever for the rating. Do not draw a lesson from the 310 s changes: neither has a usable verdict, and the 11/11 07:13 one was MIXED with other changes in the same hours. Spend effort on post quality and dislike stances instead.", "evidence": ["F5", "F6"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "Reading F6\'s \'kept\' and the buyer points/h +8% as proof that cadence or the FORMAT_EVERY change helped. Other changes fell in the same hours, so it is no verdict, and the shop numbers were net of market change only."}\n]}'
