everted these."}, {"rule": "Do not flip a number back and forth within hours (dear_depth, window_depth, fresh_premium, max_list, sku_depth), and do not step it a second time in the same direction before its last change has a closed 2 h verdict. Each flip overlaps the neighbouring changes and turns more rows into MIXED. Where evidence is needed, move one number at a time.", "evidence": ["F174", "F175", "F182", "F183", "F200", "F201", "F204", "F205", "F206"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "F174 and F175 moved window_depth opposite ways in the same minute. F182 and F183 reversed each other a minute apart. max_list went 600000 -> 900000.0 and sku_depth 2 -> 3.0 within 44 minutes (F204-F206), leaving rows with no usable verdict."}, {"rule": "To clear grade-A units priced above the market, add a clearance rule (clear_floor or the stuck rule). Do not lower market_ask, which only cuts the price of units that already sell. Keep final_frac 1.0, and sell under cost only to free stuck capital.", "evidence": ["F186", "F187", "F195", "F198"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "Lowering market_ask (F186, F198) was tried as a way to move A stock and was reverted, because the floor of those units is cost/(1-WARRANTY_Q), not the market line."}]}'
