e changing in the same hours. No row gives a verdict, so the final value of 12 rests on guesswork, not a measurement."},{"rule":"Do not cite a raw margin swing on a MIXED row as evidence for or against a number. No shop number row from 11/11 13:57 to 11/13 18:09 is a verdict, because each had other changes in its hours. Argue from board points per hour and the rivals and edges tables, or from a verdict measured on our share of paid sales.","evidence":["F101","F105","F109","F121","F145","F152","F153","F163","F165","F166","F170"],"status":"unverified","trap":"Reading +125% (11/11 20:11), -56% (11/12 00:42), +83% (11/12 21:12), +163% (11/13 09:37) or +290% (11/13 18:09) as the effect of one number, when several numbers and code changes moved in the same hours."}]}'
