, -18% and a weak +6% at -0.4 sd. 0.07 -> 0.09 gave +2% at -0.2 sd and -42% at -2.6 sd. It has been judged in both directions, so do not repeat either step without a new measurement.","evidence":["F50","F52","F61","F68","F78"],"status":"verified","trap":"The latest 0.05 row (11/13 14:35, +6%) has both arms negative and saved difference -0.4 sd. The +2% at 0.09 (11/09 18:04) came with close rate 0.68 -> 0.612. Either can be sold as a win by quoting the headline alone.","when":["11/09 18:04","11/09 23:48","11/11 11:18","11/12 11:03","11/13 14:35"]},{"rule":"Raise limits (MAX_RAISE, RAISE_GOODS, RAISE_FOOD): no direction has a clear points/h win, so leave them alone. Read the values now first. MAX_RAISE gave +3%, +1%, -20% and -2% going down and -5% going up. RAISE_FOOD 1.2 -> 1.3 gave -14%. RAISE_GOODS 0.8 -> 0.9 gave -3% and +15% at -0.1 sd.","evidence":["F46","F54","F62","F63","F65","F69","F74","F76"],"status":"verified","trap":"Close rate or saved/deal rose in some windows (11/11 19:08 close rate 0.695 -> 0.729) while points/h fell. The +15% of 11/13 02:10 is from a negative base (-0.001027 -> -0.000873) with saved difference -0.1 sd, so it is not a result to build on.","when":["11/09 10:35","11/10 08:39","11/11 14:49","11/11 19:08","11/12 01:27","11/12 14:51","11/13 02:10","11/13 11:32"]},{"rule":"Treat new ranking, scouting, penalty or plan-mode code that promises +1% to +10% with doubt. Most of it measured at or below zero on its own metric. Reverted: -4% (11/08 21:36), -5% (11/11 00:28), -9% (11/12 05:07). Others measured -6% (11/08 16:36), -2% (11/10 09:28), +0% (11/12 16:48), -3% on points/h (11/13 07:58) and -1% (11/13 13:13). Expect little, and require a points/h read before building on it.","evidence":["F39","F42","F55","F59","F66","F70","F75","F77"],"status":"verified","trap":"The meta-agent expected +1% to +10% nearly every time. \'Kept\' with a measured -2% (11/10 09:28) or -3% (11/13 07:58) is not a win, only a failure to reach the revert threshold.","