ack is not a free \'different number\'.", "evidence": ["F133", "F157", "F158", "F171", "F172", "F177", "F178", "F160", "F163"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "fresh_premium was sent to 0.15 three times (11/12 23:41, 11/13 20:54, 11/14 10:13) and to 0.2 (11/12 12:09), all values order 14 lists as negative; market_ask 0.95 was also re-sent (11/13 00:48, 06:03). Each was undone within a minute or reverted, and no verdict backs any of these rows."}, {"rule": "Do not send a change and its undo in the same minute. If the evidence cannot hold a step for a full 2 h window, do not send it. Send one net value per number per cycle.", "evidence": ["F130", "F131", "F139", "F140", "F154", "F155", "F171", "F172", "F177", "F178", "F182", "F183"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "Same-minute pairs such as floor_frac 0.66 -> 0.68 and back (11/12 11:36), floor_frac 0.68 -> 0.66 and its undo (11/12 14:51), floor_frac_food 0.57 -> 0.52 (11/12 22:18-22:19), fresh_premium (11/13 20:54-20:55, 11/14 10:13) and clear_hours 10 -> 8 -> 10.0 (11/14 11:18) leave no usable window and add noise to every neighbouring row."}, {"rule": "When the evidence for a number is thin, move one number per area per cycle so its 2 h window can be judged alone. Order 2 counts only verdicts judged one at a time as evidence.", "evidence": ["F188", "F189", "F165", "F166", "F184"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "Every row from F110 to F189 is MIXED with no verdict, because 2-5 other changes fell in the same hours. Many simultaneous steps produce no evidence, so the next cycle has nothing to build on."}]}'
