tep away from such a value and back is not a free \'different number\'.","evidence":["F133","F157","F158","F171","F172","F177","F178","F160","F161","F163"],"status":"unverified","trap":"fresh_premium was sent to 0.2 (11/12 12:09) and to 0.15 three times (11/12 23:41, 11/13 20:54, 11/14 10:13), all values order 14 lists as negative. market_ask was sent to 0.95 again (11/13 00:48, 06:03) after 1.0 had been judged +63%. These rows are MIXED and give no verdict, so only the repeat pattern is recorded."},{"rule":"Do not send a change and its undo in the same minute. If the evidence cannot hold a step for a full 2 h window, do not send it. Send one net value per number per cycle.","evidence":["F130","F131","F139","F140","F154","F155","F171","F172","F177","F178","F182","F183"],"status":"unverified","trap":"Same-minute pairs (floor_frac 0.66 -> 0.68 and back at 11/12 11:36, floor_frac_food 0.57 -> 0.52 at 22:19, fresh_premium 0.15 -> 0.18 at 11/13 20:55, clear_hours 10 -> 8 -> 10 at 11/14 11:18) leave only MIXED rows with no verdict. They cost a cycle and measured nothing."}]}'
