[11/16 00:38:18] HARNESS: try 1: 16.5 s, exit 0, answer '{"lessons":[{"rule":"Never credit a number with the raw margin swing listed beside it. Every shop number row F121-F200 is MIXED or has no verdict, so none is evidence for or against a value. Judge a move on board_pts_h over a closed window, and leave the cause open when other numbers or code changed in the same hours.","evidence":["F152","F165","F170","F176","F185"],"status":"unverified","trap":"Raw swings of +83%, +163%, +290%, +86% and +212% each sat beside other changes in the same hours. Reading any of them as the effect of the number moved would have locked in a false lesson."},{"rule":"Before proposing any number, check order 14\'s list of values whose own verdict closed negative. Returning to one needs a new measurement taken after that verdict, cited with its window. Stepping away from the value and back does not count as new evidence.","evidence":["F133","F157","F171","F177","F160","F163"],"status":"unverified","trap":"fresh_premium went to 0.2 (F133) and back to 0.15 three more times (F157, F171, F177). market_ask went to 0.95 twice (F160, F163). All of these values are on order 14\'s list, and the supervisor reverted them."},{"rule":"Send one net value per number per cycle. Do not send a change and its undo in the same minute: the pair carries no information and invites a supervisor revert. If a step cannot be held for a full 2 h window, do not send it.","evidence":["F130","F131","F139","F140","F149","F150","F154","F155","F171","F172","F177","F178","F182","F183"],"status":"unverified","trap":"Same-minute pairs appeared on floor_frac (F130/F131, F139/F140), floor_frac_food (F149/F150, F154/F155), fresh_premium (F171/F172, F177/F178) and clear_hours (F182/F183). Each pair netted to nothing and left rows that are all MIXED."},{"rule":"Do not step a number a second time in the same direction before its last step has a closed 2 h verdict (order 9). Measure the next step\'s evidence at the value now in force, not at an older one.","evidence":["F152","F159","F162","F188","F196","F200","F189","F191"],"status":"unverified","trap":"clear_hours went 14 -> 12 -> 10 -> 8 (F152, F159, F162). floor_frac_food went 0.52 -> 0.5 -> 0.48 -> 0.46 (F188, F196, F200). market_ask went 1.0 -> 1.05 -> 1.08 (F189, F191). Each step was taken before the previous one had a closed verdict, so none of them can be judged."},{"rule":"Leave market_ask at 1.0 for the rest of the round (order 15). Only a closed A/B can move it, not a play-mode step. Its only closed positive verdict is +63% at 1.0 (orders 11 and 15).","evidence":["F186","F187","F189","F191","F192","F193","F197","F198"],"status":"unverified","trap":"market_ask flipped between 1.0, 1.03, 1.05 and 1.08 more than eight times, often back within minutes (F197 at 18:14, F198 at 18:32). No value got a clean verdict, and every row is MIXED."}]}'
