 went 1.1 -> 1.15 -> 1.2 -> 1.25 -> 1.2 -> 1.25. Each step came before the last one was judged, and every row was MIXED, so the chain proves nothing."},{"rule":"Stop flipping dear_depth and depth between 5 and 6. For dear_depth only 5 and 6 are off the negative list in order 14; never go to 4 or 7. Hold the value in force until a change has a clean 2 h verdict.","evidence":["F286","F295","F296","F301","F306","F308","F312","F281","F290","F324"],"status":"unverified","trap":"dear_depth went 5 -> 6 -> 7 -> 6 -> 5 -> 6 -> 5 -> 6 -> 5 across 11/15, and depth 5 -> 6 was repeated on 11/16 02:47. Each flip was MIXED, so neither value has a verdict. The 7 step was undone within a minute."},{"rule":"Keep window_depth at 2.0 or more and sku_depth at 3 or more (orders 12 and 13). Do not re-propose a cut, and do not step window_depth within 2.0-2.3 without a closed verdict on the last step.","evidence":["F247","F248","F249","F260","F262","F291","F299","F318","F323"],"status":"unverified","trap":"window_depth wobbled 2.0 -> 2.3 -> 2.0 -> 2.25 -> 2.3 -> 2.0 -> 2.3, and sku_depth went 3 -> 4 -> 3. Every wobble was MIXED, so none taught anything. The cuts below the floors were already reverted by the supervisor or the fast guard."},{"rule":"Leave market_ask at the supervisor\'s pinned 1.0 (order 15). Do not move it to 1.03, 1.05 or 1.08 as a play-mode step; any change needs a closed A/B.","evidence":["F245","F246","F263","F274","F300","F303","F313"],"status":"unverified","trap":"market_ask moved 1.0 <-> 1.03 / 1.05 / 1.08 many times, often within hours of other changes, so no value got a clean verdict. Only 1.0 has a closed positive verdict."},{"rule":"Judge a code change on board_pts_h, not on its own target metric. A revenue gain with falling points/h is not a win. Read the shop code verdicts as warnings, not evidence, because each is MIXED or reverted.","evidence":["F253","F264","F275","F287","F311"],"status":"unverified","trap":"Revenue looked good while points/h fell: 11/14 07: