 not step it again in the same direction before the last change has a closed verdict.", "evidence": ["F151", "F156", "F169", "F190", "F203", "F224", "F225", "F226", "F228"], "status": "unverified", "trap": "ask_frac_food was lowered 0.75 -> 0.7 (F203) and again as 0.72 -> 0.7 (F225), and was reverted by the supervisor at F226 and F228. floor_frac_food 0.57 -> 0.52 (F156) was a supervisor revert. These are repeated steps without a measurement at the value in force."}\n]}'
